  "soloSidewaysNote": "soloSideways = role when one half is held sideways by one player (single Joy-Con style). Derived from the measured rotation: left half turns 90 deg counter-clockwise, right half 90 deg clockwise; face roles use the Nintendo diamond by position (right=A, bottom=B, left=Y, top=X).",
